# Providers

P1 funds and helps run dedicated partitions at three Danish HPC facilities, each matched to a
research profile. The P1 compute coordinator holds admin on them alongside each provider's HPC
team. Use the table to pick one. Each provider page covers what the partition offers, who it suits
and how to get access, and the [gallery](/gallery/) shows how to work on each.

